over my head.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:57.385
You know, but because she
was sleeping with him,

00:12:57.385 --> 00:12:59.943
hence the criminal damage, you know.

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:04.640
And then they said it was
a domestic dispute, too.

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:07.603
So they made me go to anger management,

00:13:07.603 --> 00:13:10.870
domestic classes, you know

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:14.160
domestic violence classes,
whatever, and stuff like that.

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:15.863
You know, and I did all that.

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:19.540
I mean, pass all that with
flying colors, you know

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:22.485
and did the probation
thing for three years,

00:13:22.485 --> 00:13:24.023
passed that too.

00:13:26.715 --> 00:13:28.290
And then found out though
that she was cheating

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:29.810
on me with a bunch of people, you know.

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:31.581
- [Mark] And you have now kids?

00:13:31.581 --> 00:13:34.123
- Two, but I'm not sure if they're mine.

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:38.630
Like I raised them for the
first 10 years of their life,

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:39.523
you know, but,

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:41.970
finding out that she's sleeping

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:44.900
with all of her ex boyfriends, you know,

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:46.570
people she went to school with,

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:48.180
people she works with, you know,

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:50.900
all kinds of people
because they were sending,

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:53.209
she even had a secret phone
that I didn't know about.

00:13:53.209 --> 00:13:56.920
They were sending her text
messages on stuff like,

00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:59.151
oh so when's that a piece of shit

00:13:59.151 --> 00:14:01.530
gonna go to work so I can come by

00:14:01.530 --> 00:14:04.537
and see you and the kids,
this was on my birthday.

00:14:04.537 --> 00:14:08.450
And then another text
was show me your boobs.

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:13.300
I'm like, what kind of
immature, childish shit is this?

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:14.610
I showed it to her.

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:16.220
She didn't want to even look at it though.

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:18.433
You know, she's like,
leave me alone, I'm busy.

00:14:18.433 --> 00:14:19.903
' Cause she was on Facebook.

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:25.553
Hence I call Facebook Fuckbook.

00:14:26.834 --> 00:14:28.930
- [Mark] So what are
you doing for money now?

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:31.070
- I panhandle.

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:32.163
Or recycle.

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:36.743
Trying to keep it as
legitimate as possible.

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:39.460
I mean, I would love to get a job

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:42.893
but you can't really acquire
a job without an address.

00:14:44.120 --> 00:14:45.330
I mean, they tell you, you can

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:50.330
if you lie and put down somebody
else's address, but for me

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:52.780
like that's just appalling, you know.

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:55.904
How are you going to hire
somebody and tell them initially,

00:14:55.904 --> 00:14:59.590
before they even start working, to lie?

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:02.130
You know, that doesn't seem like the kind

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:05.520
of relationship that you
would want to have transpire

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:08.210
for somebody that's going to
be working with you, you know.

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:10.543
Their initial appearance starts off

00:15:10.543 --> 00:15:12.543
with a lie about where they live.

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:16.690
And so I just told him, like
I just told him, honest,

00:15:16.690 --> 00:15:19.320
I was like, I don't know anybody out here.

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:22.023
I don't know any addresses
that I could use, you know.

00:15:23.682 --> 00:15:26.432
And so I got hired and fired
like right then and there.

00:15:27.927 --> 00:15:28.800
- [Mark] Do you have any plans?

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:30.543
Anything you'd like to
see happen down the road?

00:15:30.543 --> 00:15:33.800
- Yeah. Get back into school,

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:36.680
definitely get off drugs

00:15:38.263 --> 00:15:41.900
and hopefully do something

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:43.743
to better society.

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:47.350
You know, like I have all kinds of ideas.

00:15:47.350 --> 00:15:50.810
You know, like when I
was in seventh grade,

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:54.640
I came up with a science fair
project, how to clean pools

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:58.600
chemical free with a UV light.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:00.140
You pass water underneath it

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:04.550
and it destabilizes the
molecules' original makeup

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:08.500
of H2O and reforms it into H2O2,

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.080
hydrogen peroxide.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:13.130
As long as it's in a
enclosed containment system

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:15.770
with no outer light, you know, available.

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:17.515
And then when you put
it back into the pool

00:16:17.515 --> 00:16:21.064
after cycling the peroxide
in with regular water,

00:16:21.064 --> 00:16:25.723
it kills 99.9% of all germs
and bacteria and stuff.

00:16:25.723 --> 00:16:28.670
Or you put it back into the
pool during the day in the sun

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:33.670
having all the UV rays,
transforms the molecules

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:37.220
back to their original state of H2O.

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:40.853
So it's water cleaning water, pretty much.

00:16:42.596 --> 00:16:44.303
I won the science fair with it.

00:16:46.550 --> 00:16:48.208
Figured I could get
probably millions, just,

00:16:48.208 --> 00:16:51.490
you know, not putting it
out there, but I'm sure

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:54.720
that by now it's 'cause it's
seventh grade, long time ago.

00:16:54.720 --> 00:16:57.240
Somebody already thought of the idea

00:16:57.240 --> 00:17:01.403
or utilize my idea to do
something with it, you know.

00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:05.460
- [Mark] Well Damian, thank you so much

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:06.571
for telling me your story.

00:17:06.571 --> 00:17:08.985
- Thank you.

00:17:08.985 --> 00:17:10.403
- [Mark] Thank you for coming in.

00:17:10.403 --> 00:17:12.750
- I appreciate you very
much and what you're doing.

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:14.205
Thank you very much.

00:17:14.205 --> 00:17:15.070
God bless.

00:17:15.070 --> 00:17:16.080
- [Mark] You're interesting.

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:16.913
- Thank you.

